## Day 80 Session Plan

**3 tasks, all self-driven competitive improvements. No sponsor issues. No CI failures.**

### Task 1: Broader project instruction file compatibility
File: src/context.rs | Impact: High (first-contact)

Add AGENTS.md, .cursorrules, and .github/copilot-instructions.md to the project instruction file read list. Every major AI tool uses different instruction files now — yoyo should read them all automatically. A developer with .cursorrules from Cursor or AGENTS.md from Gemini gets immediate value without changing anything.

### Task 2: Add Lua and Zig language support to /map
File: src/commands_map.rs | Impact: Medium (competitive gap)

Two popular languages missing from /map symbol extraction. Aider supports 100+ via tree-sitter; every language we add closes that gap. Both use the lightweight pattern-based approach, keeping it maintainable.

### Task 3: Smart /init — detect existing AI tool instruction files
File: src/commands_project.rs | Impact: Medium (completes the story)

When /init generates `YOYO.md, detect if .cursorrules, AGENTS.md`, etc. already exist and acknowledge them. Prints "Found existing AI configs" and adds a section to the generated file. Completes the cross-tool compatibility story from Task 1.

